    "preamble": "Gunduboyana Venkatarathnam vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 24 September, 2020 Author: M.Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M.Satyanarayana Murthy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice M.Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.4087 Of 2020 Order:",
